 "mapping": {
  "author": "claude-wave2-m20-faults",
  "date": "2026-11-13",
  "draft_py": "# Vivien Reid (FDN). Mapped 2026-11-13 for the emblem encoding: the [-8]'s emblem rides its\n# GET_EMBLEM (EmblemSpec, controller YOU). Its abilities are the ones mapper A wrote for the FDN\n# \"Vivien Reid Emblem\" entry (2026-10-29), which the pool used to attach by name; that record is\n# retired with this one.\n# \"[+1]: Look at the top four cards of your library. You may reveal a creature or land card from\n# among them and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random\n# order.\": See the Truth's LOOK_AT (count 4), Garruk's Harbinger's \"you may reveal ... from among\n# them and put it into your hand\" (B4-reveal-one-from-among, a creature-or-land FOr) and its\n# B5b-rest-bottom-random REST with arrange RANDOM (Brightwood Tracker's record has the same three\n# steps). The [-3] and the cast carrier are the compiler's.\n_top_of_library = (Zone(kind=ZoneKind.LIBRARY, controller=ControllerRef.YOU, position=ZonePosition.TOP),)\nplus_one = ActivatedAbility(\n    cost=Cost(parts=(CostLoyalty(delta=1),)),\n    effect=Seq(\n        steps=(\n            A(Verb.LOOK_AT, {'controller': ControllerRef.YOU, 'count': QConst(value=4)}),\n            OptionalEffect(\n                inner=Seq(\n                    steps=(\n                        A(Verb.REVEAL, {'controller': ControllerRef.YOU, 'count': QConst(value=1)}),\n                        A(Verb.MOVE_ZONE, {\n                            'cards': Selector(\n                                count=QConst(value=1),\n                                mode=SelectorMode.ONE_OF,\n                                filter=FOr(\n                                    children=(\n                                        FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.TYPE_EQ, string_value='Creature'),\n                                        FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.TYPE_EQ, string_value='Land'),\n                                    ),\n                                ),\n                                zones=_top_of_library,\n                            ),\n                            'destination': Zone(kind=ZoneKind.HAND, controller=ControllerRef.YOU),\n                        }),\n                    ),\n                ),\n            ),\n            A(Verb.MOVE_ZONE, {\n                'arrange': 'RANDOM',\n                'cards': Selector(\n                    count=QConst(value=1),\n                    mode=SelectorMode.REST,\n                    filter=FAnd(children=()),\n                    zones=_top_of_library,\n                ),\n                'destination': Zone(\n                    kind=ZoneKind.LIBRARY,\n                    controller=ControllerRef.YOU,\n                    position=ZonePosition.BOTTOM,\n                ),\n            }),\n        ),\n    ),\n)\n_yours = Selector(\n    count=QUnbounded(),\n    mode=SelectorMode.ALL,\n    filter=FAnd(children=(\n        FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.CONTROLLER_IS, who=ControllerRef.YOU),\n        FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.TYPE_EQ, string_value='Creature'),\n    )),\n    zones=(Zone(kind=ZoneKind.BATTLEFIELD, controller=ControllerRef.ANY),),\n)\nemblem_static = StaticAbility(\n    effect=Seq(steps=(\n        A(Verb.MODIFY_PT, {\n            'power': PtDelta(direction=PtDirection.INCREASE, magnitude=QConst(value=2)),\n            'target': _yours,\n            'toughness': PtDelta(direction=PtDirection.INCREASE, magnitude=QConst(value=2)),\n        }),\n        A(Verb.GRANT_ABILITY, {'ability': KeywordAbility(keyword=Keyword.VIGILANCE), 'target': _yours}),\n        A(Verb.GRANT_ABILITY, {'ability': KeywordAbility(keyword=Keyword.TRAMPLE), 'target': _yours}),\n        A(Verb.GRANT_ABILITY, {'ability': KeywordAbility(keyword=Keyword.INDESTRUCTIBLE), 'target': _yours}),\n    )),\n)\nminus_eight = ActivatedAbility(\n    cost=Cost(parts=(CostLoyalty(delta=-8),)),\n    effect=A(Verb.GET_EMBLEM, {'controller': ControllerRef.YOU, 'emblem': EmblemSpec(abilities=(emblem_static,))}),\n)\nminus_three, carrier = compiled\nabilities = [plus_one, minus_three, minus_eight, carrier]\n",
  "clauses": [
   {
    "clause": "[+1]: Look at the top four cards of your library.",
    "ir": "abilities[0].cost + abilities[0].effect.steps[0]"
   },
   {
    "clause": "You may reveal a creature or land card from among them and put it into your hand.",
    "ir": "abilities[0].effect.steps[1]"
   },
   {
    "clause": "Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order.",
    "ir": "abilities[0].effect.steps[2]"
   },
   {
    "clause": "[−3]: Destroy target artifact, enchantment, or creature with flying.",
    "ir": "abilities[1]"
   },
   {
    "clause": "[−8]: You get an emblem with \"Creatures you control get +2/+2 and have vigilance, trample, and indestructible.\"",
    "ir": "abilities[2]"
   }
  ],
  "g0_warnings": [],
  "notes": "Mapped 2026-11-13 for the emblem encoding: the -8's GET_EMBLEM carries its emblem (EmblemSpec, controller YOU), the abilities mapper A wrote 2026-10-29 for the FDN 'Vivien Reid Emblem' entry, which the pool attached by name until the emblem encoding retired that path (the entry's record is removed). The +1 is See the Truth's LOOK_AT, Garruk's Harbinger's reveal-one-from-among (creature or land) and its rest-bottom-random REST (Brightwood Tracker's record has the same three steps); the -3 and the carrier are the compiler's. G1 starts at loyalty 5, so the -8 is played by tools/scenarios/mapped/FDN/vivien_reid_emblem_anthem.json."
